<title>USA: Flowers Industries Inc ups qtly dividend.</title>
<headline>Flowers Industries Inc ups qtly dividend.</headline>
<dateline>THOMASVILLE, Ga. 1997-01-10</dateline>
<text>
<p>Flowers Industries Inc said on Friday it raised the quarterly dividend to $0.155 from $0.1525 in the last quarter.</p>
<p>The new annual rate of $0.62 is a seven percent increase over the $0.58 annual rate for the previous year.</p>
<p>The dividend is payable February 7 to shareholders of record January 24.</p>
<p>Flowers Industries produces and markets a variety of branded food products and has an equity investment in a cookie and cracker business.</p>
</text>
